.TH KINTSUGI-GATE 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-gate \- opsec review gate
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi gate
review \-\-diff <file|\-> [\-\-blocking] [\-\-json]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a read-only opsec review of a diff. The gate checks for security issues
and policy violations.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-diff\fR
Diff file to review, or - for stdin (required)
.IP \fB\-\-blocking\fR
Exit non-zero on a non-pass verdict
.IP \fB\-\-json\fR
Print the typed review as JSON
.SH EXAMPLES
Review a diff file:
.PP
  $ kintsugi gate review --diff changes.patch
.PP
Review from stdin:
.PP
  $ git diff | kintsugi gate review --diff -
.PP
Blocking mode for CI:
.PP
  $ kintsugi gate review --diff changes.patch --blocking
.PP
JSON output:
.PP
  $ kintsugi gate review --diff changes.patch --json
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-dag (1)
